  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering User Intent**\n\nI\'m now focusing on user requirements for the application. The user has two options for the application name and might want to select, toggle, or combine them dynamically. Alternatively, they might want us to build an application for each. I\'m considering all these possibilities.\n\n\n**Designing the App\'s Interface**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the app\'s interface. I envision a stunning, interactive web application for the \"Turtle Rock Science Club\". I\'m planning a beautiful landing page, intuitive navigation, and interactive features like RSVP for missions (Lava Lamp Social, Stargazing, Robot Builders), a \"Lab Log\" with submission capabilities, and a Missions section with interactive sandboxes/simulators like chemistry or robotics.\n\n\n**Developing Feature Concepts**\n\nI\'ve got some new feature concepts! I\'m adding a \"Gallery / Community Photos\" tab with filters and interactive photo uploads, plus a \"Publicity & News\" tab for announcements. Also, I\'m integrating an \"About Us & FAQs\" section with an accordion and a \"Dashboard / Join the Club\" feature with sign-up and \"badge\" earning. I think this is a complete and functional concept, so I\'m investigating persistence options!\n\n\n"
