  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Layout Components**\n\nI\'m now focused on the layout components. I\'m building `Header.tsx` and `Footer.tsx` within `/src/components/`. The next step is visualizing the header and footer; I\'m exploring potential brand names such as \"Turtle Rock Science Club\" \360\237\220\242 or \"Kinetic Lab |\".\n\n\n**Designing Navigation Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating the navigation components into `Header.tsx`, which will contain missions, lab log, interactive lab, a gallery, and about/FAQ pages. I envision a \"Join the Club\" button, which transforms into a profile summary after joining, showing level, XP, and reservations. I want a toggle for identity themes (\"Turtle Rock\" or \"Kinetic Lab\") with theme indicators, and I\'m adding a neat toggle button next to the profile.\n\n\n"
