  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Interactive Labs**\n\nI\'m now focusing on designing the interactive labs component, `VirtualLab.tsx`. The initial task is to brainstorm compelling virtual experiments. My first idea is \"Lava Lamp Density Social,\" where users choose fluid colors like Red, Amber, Teal, or Royal. This should be quite engaging.\n\n\n**Developing New Experiments**\n\nI\'ve been fleshing out more experiment ideas. I think \"Lava Lamp Density Social\" is solid, so I added two more. \"Volcano Chemical Blast\" lets users mix ingredients for a colorful eruption. \"Stargazing Constellation Telescope\" provides an interactive way to explore constellations, complete with a star chart. I\'m focusing on making each experience visually engaging and rewarding.\n\n\n"
