  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Modularizing the Layout**\n\nI\'ve made significant strides in modularizing the application\'s structure. Components like `Header.tsx`, `Footer.tsx`, and `HeroSection.tsx` are now fully implemented. Each component represents a distinct section of the overall page layout, increasing code reusability. I focused on making the header interactive based on the active view, and the footer is mostly static, with relevant links.\n\n\n**Defining New App Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on additional components. I\'ve outlined `UpcomingMissions.tsx`, `VirtualLab.tsx`, `PhotoGallery.tsx`, `AboutUs.tsx`, and `Dashboard.tsx`. I\'m especially excited about the interactive simulators planned for `VirtualLab.tsx`. I have also begun the requirements analysis for the **Join/Sign-Up Modal**! It will feature form fields for child\'s name, parent\'s information, age, and consent checkboxes. Upon successful submission, the system will initialize a level-1 profile with associated XP and badges, likely with a celebratory visual effect.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
