  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Summarizing Applet Success**\n\nGreat news! I\'ve successfully linted and compiled the applet without any errors. My next step will be summarizing this progress concisely, per the guidelines, keeping things simple and direct.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the full transition of the Turtle Rock & Kinetic Lab application into the **Bento Grid** design theme. Here is a proportional overview of the custom work completed to wrap up the design execution:\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Layout Architecture\n- **Glassmorphism Base Theme**: Applied translucent slate styling across all screens using dark high-contrast panels (`bg-zinc-900/40`), subtle glowing gradients, and light-reflecting glass dividers (`border-white/10`).\n- **Typography Pairings**: Integrated **Space Grotesk** display fonts for scientific headings and **JetBrains Mono** for technical status lines, coordinates, and laboratory indicators.\n- **Dynamic Accent Identities**: Coloration adapts seamlessly to active views: glowing emerald greens for *Turtle Rock* tasks and electric cobalt blues for *Kinetic* experiments.\n\n### \360\237\247\252 Key Styled Modules & Interaction\n- **Interactive Virtual Bench (`VirtualLab`)**: Styled the coordinate stellar mapper, chemical lava-lamp simulator, and eruption peak pressure gauge with real-time controls, glowing dials, and a monospaced log tracker.\n- **Sleek Discovery Board (`Dashboard`)**: Overhauled the profile tracker with a smooth custom XP progress indicator, an interactive status title generator, and detailed badge status lists.\n- **Scientist Credentials (`JoinModal`)**: Created a polished registration form featuring glassmorphic overlays, dark inputs, and customized safety oath checkboxes.\n- **Photo Gallery (`PhotoGallery`)**: Implemented Bento grid filters, a modern file drop zone, and high-contrast image aspect grids.\n- **Announcements & FAQs (`LabLogAnnouncements` & `AboutUs`)**: Formatted newsletter signups, feed cards, and responsive disclosure accordions with translucent glass borders.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 333412660
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
