.). I\'m going to re-examine the image in the prompt to ascertain if one already exists.\n\n\n**Exploring Conversion Options**\n\nI\'m now exploring conversion possibilities. I\'ve realized that client-side conversion, using HTML5 Canvas, might be ideal for converting the SVG to PNG. I am looking for a simple script, as I see no server-side package options like `sharp` or `canvas`. I am questioning whether the conversion needs to occur on the server or if we should convert it in the browser directly. \"The ACTUAL logo png\" could imply a specific file or URL to fetch, so I will investigate this further.\n\n\n"
